      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.3,
        "t": 741.9146599999999,
        "r": 258.4145940000001,
        "b": 733.0429409281768
      },
      "content": "Home Position Setting Method"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0960",
      "reading_order": 1239,
      "section": "3-3-2. Tool Post Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540396,
        "t": 724.8746479999999,
        "r": 293.49862199999995,
        "b": 648.0232409281768
      },
      "content": "Unclamp the turret by simultaneously pressing '[SPINDLE STOP]' and '[SELECT]',  '[FEED  HOLD]'  on the Operating Panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0961",
      "reading_order": 1240,
      "section": "3-3-2. Tool Post Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.83991,
        "t": 639.915068,
        "r": 293.49962400000015,
        "b": 580.043552928177
      },
      "content": "The  Message,  '2067  TURRET COMPULSORY  UNCLAMP'  will be displayed on the alarm screen. Parameter K0#3=\"1\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0962",
      "reading_order": 1241,
      "section": "3-3-2. Tool Post Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.83991,
        "t": 571.87526,
        "r": 293.503632,
        "b": 495.0238529281769
      },
      "content": "Unclamp the turret by Simultaneously pressing [TURRET  INDEX],  [ROTATING TOOL  STOP]  on  the  operating panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0963",
      "reading_order": 1242,
      "section": "3-3-2. Tool Post Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540396,
        "t": 469.87566800000013,
        "r": 296.89640399999996,
        "b": 461.0039489281769
      },
      "content": "Press the Emergency Stop switch."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0964",
      "reading_order": 1243,
      "section": "3-3-2. Tool Post Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540396,
        "t": 282.91649600000005,
        "r": 300.4865700000002,
        "b": 206.00496892817682
      },
      "content": "Turn the turret by hand and set the No.  1  tool.  Turn  the  turret  and remain it on the position where the arrows of turret and tool post body are aligned."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0965",
      "reading_order": 1244,
      "section": "3-3-2. Tool Post Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540396,
        "t": 180.91690400000005,
        "r": 300.48556799999994,
        "b": 155.00517292817688
      },
      "content": "Release the Emergency Stop state and press the \"STAND-BY\" switch."
    },
